DTSTAMP:20260825T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260825
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260826
SUMMARY:Lunch: Beef & Cheese Taco (beef) / Grilled Cheese Sandwich (vegetar
 ian) / Protein Box (fresh)
DESCRIPTION:\nBeef & Cheese Taco (beef)\n    \n \n    \nGrilled Cheese San
 dwich (vegetarian)\n    \n \n    \nProtein Box (fresh)\n    \n \n    \nO
 ne breakfast is available to all students at no cost. All meals are served
  with fruit variety and 1% low-fat or non-fat chocolate milk (soy milk ava
 ilable upon request). Students must choose at least one fruit option. All 
 grains offered are whole grain rich. Menu subject to change based on produ
 ct availability.\n    \nThis institution is an equal opportunity provider.
 \n
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
